    "show_share": true,
    "description": "There are those in this world who give of their time and effort, indeed give of themselves selflessly with no regard for any compensation, a casual thank you here and there being more than enough for them. Working without any official designation or authority, yet helping everyone, being there when it matters, they are volunteers.",
